# A keyword counter on a permanent gives it the keyword in layer 6 at the timestamp of its counters (CR 122.1b, 613.1f, 613.7c),
# so "loses all abilities" does not take the lifelink of a counter put on afterwards (the Abigale, Eloquent First-Year
# ruling: "If the affected creature gains an ability after Abigale's last ability resolves, it will keep that ability").
# Oko's +1 turns Bot1's Mox Ruby into a 3/3 Elk creature that loses all abilities; afterwards Arwen's ability puts a +1/+1
# counter and a lifelink counter on it and it gains indestructible until end of turn (a later effect, so it also stays).
# Bot1 turn 1: Black Lotus (GGG), Mox Emerald, Mox Sapphire, Mox Ruby and Mox Pearl pay Arwen {1}{G}{W}, Oko {1}{G}{U}
# and Arwen's {1}.

